      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "- So, you can't have many Pods \n    ° reading from \n    and \n    ° writing to \n    the storage at the same time\n\n- If that is what you want, \n    ==> then you need a different \n        access mode",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- So, you can't have many Pods \n    ° reading from \n    and \n    ° writing to \n    the storage at the same time\n\n- If that is what you want, \n    ==> then you need a different \n        access mode",
